abstract: "Canonical freeze-stage repository for the LSC neutrino and Gallium research line. The repository presents LSC as an unvalidated constrained phenomenological validation framework, not as confirmed new physics, and preserves canonical, validation, implementation, audit, provenance, data-requirement, and historical materials for pre-BEST-2 review."
